          "quote_or_absence": "The notice does not quantify community-level or local-government effects of the new budget ceilings."
        }
      ],
      "comment_leverage": "Ask EPA to describe who will experience the practical effects of the new conformity budgets and any monitoring changes."
    },
    {
      "flaw_key": "targetability_abuse_surface",
